  "description": "The Nominal Solutions Core API Extensions library provides a set of essential tools and configurations to streamline the development of ASP.NET Core APIs. This package includes a customizable Basic Authentication handler, comprehensive Swagger configuration, and API versioning support. With built-in support for Serilog logging and seamless integration into existing projects, this library is designed to help you build robust and secure APIs with minimal setup.",
